  - the organism flashcards and the specimen-routing exercise;
  - the design system (colour tokens, typography, layout and components);
  - the HTML, CSS and JavaScript source code;
  - the selection, coordination and arrangement of all of the above,
    which constitutes a protected compilation.

No part of this work may be reproduced, distributed, publicly displayed,
